  "description": "The T.E.M.P.O. RIDE focuses on simplicity and reliability to meet the needs of riders who want the right bike that’s always ready to ride anywhere.\n• The ROCKSHOX Pike Select fork stands out for its excellent weight/stiffness ratio and simple and effective adjustments for low-speed compression and rebound. The Deluxe Select+ shock surprises with its ability to absorb impacts without bottoming out. The valve system is adapted to the T.E.M.P.O.'s kinematics. Its rebound is adjustable, and the lock-out lever is easily accessible.\n• TRP TRAIL EVO 4-piston brakes are consistent and reliable.\n• SPANK Spike Race 33 rims and their reinforced hubs are perfect for riders looking for reliability. They offer good dynamism thanks to their high profile and low weight.\n• The SRAM NX Eagle 12-speed drivetrain features a wide 11-50t cassette to tackle any challenge.",
